# This repository is public, and cycle bundles are copied in from a private
# one. Everything below is a belt-and-braces guard against a stray file riding
# along with a bundle — nothing in a legitimate bundle matches any of these
# patterns.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
credentials.json
secrets.json

# The runner's private working state. A cycle is published by copying the
# finished bundle in; the runner's own out/ directory must never appear here,
# and neither must a nonce for a cycle that has not closed yet.
out/
.nonce*
corpus-*.json

# Agent instructions and harness state. These describe how we work internally
# and belong in the private repos, not on a public surface.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/

# Tooling noise
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
